From: Zurker <91011862+hershate@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 14:24:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Raid.getTotalRaidersAlive
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

每个 raid tick 及刷怪组循环内调用；普通循环累加 set 大小，替代
stream().mapToInt(Set::size).sum()。

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/raid/Raid.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/raid/Raid.java
index 8c6b8439bbfb8d9763767fda7985f26f14c05f3f..8b63faae76da27714ba97d2ebbb066360a044169 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/raid/Raid.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/raid/Raid.java
@@ -629,7 +629,13 @@ public class Raid {
     }
 
     public int getTotalRaidersAlive() {
-        return this.groupRaiderMap.values().stream().mapToInt(Set::size).sum();
+        // Papo start - plain counted loop instead of stream/mapToInt/sum
+        int total = 0;
+        for (java.util.Set<Raider> set : this.groupRaiderMap.values()) {
+            total += set.size();
+        }
+        return total;
+        // Papo end
     }
 
     public void removeFromRaid(ServerLevel level, Raider raider, boolean wanderedOutOfRaid) {
